  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conslutancy support to the civil society core-support programme - NCG Conslutancy support to the civil society core-support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultst&#xf6;d till k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;dsprogrammet f&#xf6;r det civila samh&#xe4;llet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim for this procurement is to contract consultancy support for the core-support programme. The procurement will be done jointly with Kiev. Within the ToR are; system-based audits, recommendations, support of implementing these recommendations during the pre-core phase, support to ongoing core support partners through trainings etc. Consultants will also assist the embassies in follow-up on the organizational development during the core support period.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under 2014 p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rjade ambassaden ge st&#xf6;d till civilsamh&#xe4;llet i form av k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d och fem organisationer genomgick systemrevisioner och 4 organisationer fick f&#xf6;rberedande k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d. Ambassaden tar under juni 2016 beslut om k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till dessa organisationer. Under h&#xf6;sten 2016 kommer ytterligare 5 organisationer p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rja arbetet mot k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d med systemrevisioner och m&#xf6;jliga f&#xf6;rberedande k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d. 

Upphandlat st&#xf6;d kommer bist&#xe5; ambassaden att fatta beslut samt ge brett organisatoriskt st&#xf6;d till organisationerna.</narrative>
  </description>
